   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "directed": "[long pause] Tantrasāra — Chapter 5"
  },
  {
   "id": "b2",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "पञ्चममाह्निकम् — Āṇavaprakāśanam",
   "directed": "[slowly] पञ्चममाह्निकम् — Āṇavaprakāśanam"
  },
  {
   "id": "b3",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The Method of the Little Bloke: or, congratulations, you’re literally infinite consciousness, but apparently we’re going to need some breathing exercises to convince you.",
   "directed": "The Method of the Little Bloke: or, congratulations, you’re literally infinite consciousness, but apparently we’re going to need some breathing exercises to convince you."
  },
  {
   "id": "b4",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Right then.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Right then."
  },
  {
   "id": "b5",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Last chapter, we discussed Śāktopāya.",
   "directed": "Last chapter, we discussed Śāktopāya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b6",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The method of Śakti.",
   "directed": "The method of Śakti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b7",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Beautiful method.",
   "directed": "Beautiful method."
  },
  {
   "id": "b8",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You take your conceptual understanding, refine it through correct reasoning, and gradually all those ridiculous ideas about being a separate little creature start falling apart.",
   "directed": "You take your conceptual understanding, refine it through correct reasoning, and gradually all those ridiculous ideas about being a separate little creature start falling apart."
  },
  {
   "id": "b9",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Very sophisticated.",
   "directed": "Very sophisticated."
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But there’s a problem.",
   "directed": "But there’s a problem."
  },
  {
   "id": "b11",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Some of you are absolutely hopeless at it.",
   "directed": "Some of you are absolutely hopeless at it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b12",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You sit there thinking:",
   "directed": "[short pause] You sit there thinking:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b13",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I am infinite consciousness.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I am infinite consciousness.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b14",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Then:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b15",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“But how can I be infinite consciousness if I’m sitting in a chair?”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “But how can I be infinite consciousness if I’m sitting in a chair?”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b16",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Then:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b17",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Who is sitting in the chair?”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Who is sitting in the chair?”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b18",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Then:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b19",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“What’s a chair?”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “What’s a chair?”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b20",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And before you know it, you’ve spent three hours arguing with yourself about furniture.",
   "directed": "And before you know it, you’ve spent three hours arguing with yourself about furniture."
  },
  {
   "id": "b21",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So clearly, we’re going to need something else.",
   "directed": "So clearly, we’re going to need something else."
  },
  {
   "id": "b22",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Welcome to Āṇavopāya.",
   "directed": "Welcome to Āṇavopāya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b23",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The method of the aṇu.",
   "directed": "The method of the aṇu."
  },
  {
   "id": "b24",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The apparently limited individual.",
   "directed": "The apparently limited individual."
  },
  {
   "id": "b25",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And don’t get offended by the name.",
   "directed": "And don’t get offended by the name."
  },
  {
   "id": "b26",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Aṇu means something minute, atomic, tiny.",
   "directed": "Aṇu means something minute, atomic, tiny."
  },
  {
   "id": "b27",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "In this context, it means consciousness appearing in the restricted condition of individuality.",
   "directed": "In this context, it means consciousness appearing in the restricted condition of individuality."
  },
  {
   "id": "b28",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So yes, you’re infinite Śiva.",
   "directed": "So yes, you’re infinite Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b29",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But you’re experiencing yourself as a tiny bloke with a body and a mind.",
   "directed": "But you’re experiencing yourself as a tiny bloke with a body and a mind."
  },
  {
   "id": "b30",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that’s precisely where we’re going to begin.",
   "directed": "And that’s precisely where we’re going to begin."
  },
  {
   "id": "b31",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "1. When thinking needs a bit of help\nNow, remember what we said about vikalpa.",
   "directed": "1. When thinking needs a bit of help\nNow, remember what we said about vikalpa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b32",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Conceptual understanding.",
   "directed": "Conceptual understanding."
  },
  {
   "id": "b33",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "In Śāktopāya, correct understanding can refine itself without depending on another practical method.",
   "directed": "In Śāktopāya, correct understanding can refine itself without depending on another practical method."
  },
  {
   "id": "b34",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Through the grace of śuddhavidyā, pure knowledge, thought becomes the expression of the supreme Lord’s own power.",
   "directed": "Through the grace of śuddhavidyā, pure knowledge, thought becomes the expression of the supreme Lord’s own power."
  },
  {
   "id": "b35",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Brilliant.",
   "directed": "Brilliant."
  },
  {
   "id": "b36",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But suppose your understanding can’t refine itself quite so easily.",
   "directed": "But suppose your understanding can’t refine itself quite so easily."
  },
  {
   "id": "b37",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Suppose it needs assistance.",
   "directed": "Suppose it needs assistance."
  },
  {
   "id": "b38",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Something concrete.",
   "directed": "Something concrete."
  },
  {
   "id": "b39",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Something you can actually work with.",
   "directed": "Something you can actually work with."
  },
  {
   "id": "b40",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then we use supports belonging to your apparently limited condition.",
   "directed": "Then we use supports belonging to your apparently limited condition."
  },
  {
   "id": "b41",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ve got four principal domains, expressed through five forms of practice.",
   "directed": "We’ve got four principal domains, expressed through five forms of practice."
  },
  {
   "id": "b42",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Buddhi — the intellect and imaginative faculty, used in dhyāna, meditation.\nPrāṇa — vital energy, approached through uccāra and the subtler practice of varṇa, phonemic resonance.\nDeha — the body, approached through karaṇa, particular bodily configurations.\nBāhya — external objects, such as ritual vessels, altars and liṅgas, used in worship.\nAnd that’s āṇavopāya.",
   "directed": "Buddhi — the intellect and imaginative faculty, used in dhyāna, meditation.\nPrāṇa — vital energy, approached through uccāra and the subtler practice of varṇa, phonemic resonance.\nDeha — the body, approached through karaṇa, particular bodily configurations.\nBāhya — external objects, such as ritual vessels, altars and liṅgas, used in worship.\nAnd that’s āṇavopāya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b43",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’re using limited things to bring about recognition of the unlimited.",
   "directed": "We’re using limited things to bring about recognition of the unlimited."
  },
  {
   "id": "b44",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, you might object.",
   "directed": "Now, you might object."
  },
  {
   "id": "b45",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "man",
   "text": "“Abhinava, mate, didn’t you spend the entire last chapter telling us that Śiva can’t be produced by practices?”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Abhinava, mate, didn’t you spend the entire last chapter telling us that Śiva can’t be produced by practices?”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b46",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Indeed I did.",
   "directed": "Indeed I did."
  },
  {
   "id": "b47",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that hasn’t changed.",
   "directed": "And that hasn’t changed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b48",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’re not making Śiva.",
   "directed": "We’re not making Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b49",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’re refining the limited individual’s capacity to recognise Śiva.",
   "directed": "We’re refining the limited individual’s capacity to recognise Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b50",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The method changes. The reality being recognised doesn’t.",
   "directed": "The method changes. The reality being recognised doesn’t."
  },
  {
   "id": "b51",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And now, let me teach you a particular meditation.",
   "directed": "And now, let me teach you a particular meditation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b52",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "One that I received from my own revered teacher, Śambhunātha.",
   "directed": "One that I received from my own revered teacher, Śambhunātha."
  },
  {
   "id": "b53",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "This one’s absolutely magnificent.",
   "directed": "This one’s absolutely magnificent."
  },
  {
   "id": "b54",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "2. The fire-wheel of Mahābhairava\nRight.",
   "directed": "2. The fire-wheel of Mahābhairava\nRight."
  },
  {
   "id": "b55",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Let’s recall what we’ve established.",
   "directed": "Let’s recall what we’ve established."
  },
  {
   "id": "b56",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The highest principle is svaprakāśa.",
   "directed": "The highest principle is svaprakāśa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b57",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Self-luminous consciousness.",
   "directed": "Self-luminous consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b58",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And it pervades all the tattvas.",
   "directed": "And it pervades all the tattvas."
  },
  {
   "id": "b59",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Every level of manifestation.",
   "directed": "Every level of manifestation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b60",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "From the highest divine principles right down to physical matter.",
   "directed": "From the highest divine principles right down to physical matter."
  },
  {
   "id": "b61",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, in this meditation, you’re going to contemplate that supreme reality within the awareness of your own Heart.",
   "directed": "Now, in this meditation, you’re going to contemplate that supreme reality within the awareness of your own Heart."
  },
  {
   "id": "b62",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Nija-hṛdaya-bodha.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Nija-hṛdaya-bodha."
  },
  {
   "id": "b63",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And I don’t mean merely imagining something inside your anatomical heart.",
   "directed": "And I don’t mean merely imagining something inside your anatomical heart."
  },
  {
   "id": "b64",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "I mean the centre of awareness.",
   "directed": "I mean the centre of awareness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b65",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The Heart in which experience manifests.",
   "directed": "The Heart in which experience manifests."
  },
  {
   "id": "b66",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, within that Heart, we’re going to bring together three things.",
   "directed": "Now, within that Heart, we’re going to bring together three things."
  },
  {
   "id": "b67",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "अग्नि\nAgni",
   "directed": "[slowly] अग्नि\nAgni"
  },
  {
   "id": "b68",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Fire — Vahni",
   "directed": "Fire — Vahni"
  },
  {
   "id": "b69",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pramātṛ: the knower, the subject of experience.",
   "directed": "Pramātṛ: the knower, the subject of experience."
  },
  {
   "id": "b70",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "सूर्य\nSūrya",
   "directed": "[slowly] सूर्य\nSūrya"
  },
  {
   "id": "b71",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sun — Arka",
   "directed": "Sun — Arka"
  },
  {
   "id": "b72",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pramāṇa: the process or means of knowing.",
   "directed": "Pramāṇa: the process or means of knowing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b73",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "चन्द्र\nCandra",
   "directed": "[slowly] चन्द्र\nCandra"
  },
  {
   "id": "b74",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Moon — Soma",
   "directed": "Moon — Soma"
  },
  {
   "id": "b75",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Prameya: the object that is known.",
   "directed": "Prameya: the object that is known."
  },
  {
   "id": "b76",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now this is extremely important.",
   "directed": "Now this is extremely important."
  },
  {
   "id": "b77",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Ordinarily, you experience these as separate.",
   "directed": "Ordinarily, you experience these as separate."
  },
  {
   "id": "b78",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "There’s you.",
   "directed": "There’s you."
  },
  {
   "id": "b79",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "There’s the act of knowing.",
   "directed": "There’s the act of knowing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b80",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And there’s the thing you’re knowing.",
   "directed": "And there’s the thing you’re knowing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b81",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "For example:",
   "directed": "[short pause] For example:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b82",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You see a tree.",
   "directed": "You see a tree."
  },
  {
   "id": "b83",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You’re the observer.",
   "directed": "You’re the observer."
  },
  {
   "id": "b84",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Seeing is the process.",
   "directed": "Seeing is the process."
  },
  {
   "id": "b85",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The tree is the object.",
   "directed": "The tree is the object."
  },
  {
   "id": "b86",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Three things.",
   "directed": "Three things."
  },
  {
   "id": "b87",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Simple enough.",
   "directed": "Simple enough."
  },
  {
   "id": "b88",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
