  },
  {
   "id": "b186",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That belongs to consciousness itself.",
   "directed": "That belongs to consciousness itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b187",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Svātantrya.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Svātantrya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b188",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So the point isn’t to become a talented imaginary pyromaniac.",
   "directed": "So the point isn’t to become a talented imaginary pyromaniac."
  },
  {
   "id": "b189",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s to recognise that the very power by which things appear, persist and disappear is the power of your own essential awareness.",
   "directed": "It’s to recognise that the very power by which things appear, persist and disappear is the power of your own essential awareness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b190",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And when this is recognised fully, Abhinavagupta makes an enormous claim.",
   "directed": "And when this is recognised fully, Abhinavagupta makes an enormous claim."
  },
  {
   "id": "b191",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sadya eva bhairavībhāvaḥ.",
   "directed": "Sadya eva bhairavībhāvaḥ."
  },
  {
   "id": "b192",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The state of Bhairava arises immediately.",
   "directed": "The state of Bhairava arises immediately."
  },
  {
   "id": "b193",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And through repeated practice, he says, the various desired siddhis or attainments may also be accomplished.",
   "directed": "And through repeated practice, he says, the various desired siddhis or attainments may also be accomplished."
  },
  {
   "id": "b194",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now we’re getting into traditional tantric claims about extraordinary powers, not something I’m asking you to accept as an established scientific fact.",
   "directed": "Now we’re getting into traditional tantric claims about extraordinary powers, not something I’m asking you to accept as an established scientific fact."
  },
  {
   "id": "b195",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But the central insight is clear.",
   "directed": "But the central insight is clear."
  },
  {
   "id": "b196",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The fire-wheel is a means of recognising the unity of the knower, knowing and known.",
   "directed": "The fire-wheel is a means of recognising the unity of the knower, knowing and known."
  },
  {
   "id": "b197",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And Abhinavagupta gives us three summary verses.",
   "directed": "And Abhinavagupta gives us three summary verses."
  },
  {
   "id": "b198",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Their sense is this:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Their sense is this:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b199",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Bring the self-luminous triad into the blissful Heart.",
   "directed": "Bring the self-luminous triad into the blissful Heart."
  },
  {
   "id": "b200",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Contemplate the all-pervading Lord of the wheel, radiating the twelve great powers through the openings of the senses, manifesting and withdrawing external appearances.",
   "directed": "Contemplate the all-pervading Lord of the wheel, radiating the twelve great powers through the openings of the senses, manifesting and withdrawing external appearances."
  },
  {
   "id": "b201",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then contemplate every external and internal object as absorbed into that wheel, resting in the Self.",
   "directed": "Then contemplate every external and internal object as absorbed into that wheel, resting in the Self."
  },
  {
   "id": "b202",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Thus the Self becomes manifest in its fullness.",
   "directed": "Thus the Self becomes manifest in its fullness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b203",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Right.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Right."
  },
  {
   "id": "b204",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That’s dhyāna.",
   "directed": "That’s dhyāna."
  },
  {
   "id": "b205",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Meditation.",
   "directed": "Meditation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b206",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now we’re going to discuss something even more intimate.",
   "directed": "Now we’re going to discuss something even more intimate."
  },
  {
   "id": "b207",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Something you’ve been doing since the day you were born.",
   "directed": "Something you’ve been doing since the day you were born."
  },
  {
   "id": "b208",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Breathing.",
   "directed": "Breathing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b209",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And apparently you’ve been doing it without understanding the cosmic implications.",
   "directed": "And apparently you’ve been doing it without understanding the cosmic implications."
  },
  {
   "id": "b210",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Typical.",
   "directed": "Typical."
  },
  {
   "id": "b211",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "5. The five winds of life\nNow we’re getting into uccāra.",
   "directed": "5. The five winds of life\nNow we’re getting into uccāra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b212",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The elevation of vital energy.",
   "directed": "The elevation of vital energy."
  },
  {
   "id": "b213",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And before you start doing some heroic breathing exercise and passing out on the floor, understand that we’re examining a traditional contemplative process involving prāṇa, awareness and repose.",
   "directed": "And before you start doing some heroic breathing exercise and passing out on the floor, understand that we’re examining a traditional contemplative process involving prāṇa, awareness and repose."
  },
  {
   "id": "b214",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "This isn’t a competition to see how long you can hold your breath.",
   "directed": "This isn’t a competition to see how long you can hold your breath."
  },
  {
   "id": "b215",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Right.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Right."
  },
  {
   "id": "b216",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ve got five forms of vital energy.",
   "directed": "We’ve got five forms of vital energy."
