  },
  {
   "id": "b400",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Antar-viśrānti.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Antar-viśrānti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b401",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And now we’ve arrived at the actual purpose of the practice.",
   "directed": "And now we’ve arrived at the actual purpose of the practice."
  },
  {
   "id": "b402",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because through resting in these stages individually, in combinations, or together, the practitioner discovers something beyond identification with the particular body, breath and other limited supports.",
   "directed": "Because through resting in these stages individually, in combinations, or together, the practitioner discovers something beyond identification with the particular body, breath and other limited supports."
  },
  {
   "id": "b403",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Viśrānti-tattva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Viśrānti-tattva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b404",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The reality of repose itself.",
   "directed": "The reality of repose itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b405",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The practice began with prāṇa.",
   "directed": "The practice began with prāṇa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b406",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But prāṇa was never the final destination.",
   "directed": "But prāṇa was never the final destination."
  },
  {
   "id": "b407",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The movements of vital energy serve to refine understanding until the practitioner recognises the consciousness in which those movements occur.",
   "directed": "The movements of vital energy serve to refine understanding until the practitioner recognises the consciousness in which those movements occur."
  },
  {
   "id": "b408",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that, says Abhinavagupta, is also the secret of the seed syllables associated with creation and dissolution.",
   "directed": "And that, says Abhinavagupta, is also the secret of the seed syllables associated with creation and dissolution."
  },
  {
   "id": "b409",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ll come back to those shortly.",
   "directed": "We’ll come back to those shortly."
  },
  {
   "id": "b410",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But first, he’s got something else to explain.",
   "directed": "But first, he’s got something else to explain."
  },
  {
   "id": "b411",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Apparently, as this practice deepens, some rather strange experiences can occur.",
   "directed": "Apparently, as this practice deepens, some rather strange experiences can occur."
  },
  {
   "id": "b412",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "8. The five extraordinary states\nNow, I want you to understand something.",
   "directed": "8. The five extraordinary states\nNow, I want you to understand something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b413",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "These are traditional descriptions of states associated with contemplative absorption.",
   "directed": "These are traditional descriptions of states associated with contemplative absorption."
