   "directed": "Let the object be filled through that awareness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b554",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Rest in that fullness.",
   "directed": "Rest in that fullness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b555",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And when fullness has been recognised, dissolve the distinction between knower and known.",
   "directed": "And when fullness has been recognised, dissolve the distinction between knower and known."
  },
  {
   "id": "b556",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Mātṛ-meya-vibhāga.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Mātṛ-meya-vibhāga."
  },
  {
   "id": "b557",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then rest in pervasion.",
   "directed": "Then rest in pervasion."
  },
  {
   "id": "b558",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Vyāpti.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Vyāpti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b559",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The entire world of experience, from waking onward, is understood as resting in these modes of consciousness.",
   "directed": "The entire world of experience, from waking onward, is understood as resting in these modes of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b560",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And through sustained practice, the practitioner approaches the abode of the very self-awareness through which manifestation and withdrawal take place.",
   "directed": "And through sustained practice, the practitioner approaches the abode of the very self-awareness through which manifestation and withdrawal take place."
  },
  {
   "id": "b561",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Sṛṣṭi-saṃhṛd-vimarśa-dhāman.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Sṛṣṭi-saṃhṛd-vimarśa-dhāman."
  },
  {
   "id": "b562",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The locus of consciousness’s own creative and dissolving self-apprehension.",
   "directed": "The locus of consciousness’s own creative and dissolving self-apprehension."
  },
  {
   "id": "b563",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now that is a phrase worth remembering.",
   "directed": "Now that is a phrase worth remembering."
  },
  {
   "id": "b564",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because it expresses what the whole chapter is about.",
   "directed": "Because it expresses what the whole chapter is about."
  },
  {
   "id": "b565",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not becoming a better breather.",
   "directed": "Not becoming a better breather."
  },
  {
   "id": "b566",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not collecting unusual bodily sensations.",
   "directed": "Not collecting unusual bodily sensations."
  },
  {
   "id": "b567",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not becoming obsessed with inner lights and mystical fireworks.",
   "directed": "Not becoming obsessed with inner lights and mystical fireworks."
  },
  {
   "id": "b568",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But recognising the self-aware freedom in which experience is created and withdrawn.",
   "directed": "But recognising the self-aware freedom in which experience is created and withdrawn."
  },
  {
   "id": "b569",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And with that, we’re finished with uccāra.",
   "directed": "And with that, we’re finished with uccāra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b570",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But we’re not finished with prāṇa.",
   "directed": "But we’re not finished with prāṇa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b571",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because now comes its subtler expression.",
   "directed": "Because now comes its subtler expression."
  },
  {
   "id": "b572",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sound.",
   "directed": "Sound."
  },
  {
   "id": "b573",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "11. Varṇa — the secret vibration of Sanskrit\nRight.",
   "directed": "11. Varṇa — the secret vibration of Sanskrit\nRight."
  },
  {
   "id": "b574",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Remember Chapter Three?",
   "directed": "Remember Chapter Three?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b575",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The entire cosmic alphabet?",
   "directed": "The entire cosmic alphabet?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b576",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "All those vowels?",
   "directed": "All those vowels?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b577",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "All those consonants?",
   "directed": "All those consonants?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b578",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The divine powers of Śiva expressed through sound?",
   "directed": "The divine powers of Śiva expressed through sound?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b579",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Well, they’re back.",
   "directed": "Well, they’re back."
  },
  {
   "id": "b580",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But now we’re not merely investigating phonemic cosmology.",
   "directed": "But now we’re not merely investigating phonemic cosmology."
  },
  {
   "id": "b581",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’re investigating a practice.",
   "directed": "We’re investigating a practice."
  },
  {
   "id": "b582",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Varṇa-vidhi.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Varṇa-vidhi."
  },
  {
   "id": "b583",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The method of phonemes.",
   "directed": "The method of phonemes."
  },
  {
   "id": "b584",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And Abhinavagupta begins by describing a subtle resonance arising within uccāra itself.",
   "directed": "And Abhinavagupta begins by describing a subtle resonance arising within uccāra itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b585",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Dhvani.",
   "directed": "Dhvani."
  },
  {
   "id": "b586",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sound.",
   "directed": "Sound."
  },
  {
   "id": "b587",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not necessarily a clearly audible sound.",
   "directed": "Not necessarily a clearly audible sound."
  },
  {
   "id": "b588",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A subtle vibration, almost an imitation of something unmanifest.",
   "directed": "A subtle vibration, almost an imitation of something unmanifest."
  },
  {
   "id": "b589",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Avyakta.",
   "directed": "Avyakta."
  },
  {
   "id": "b590",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And this varṇa has its principal expressions in two important seed-mantras.",
   "directed": "And this varṇa has its principal expressions in two important seed-mantras."
  },
  {
   "id": "b591",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "One associated with creation.",
   "directed": "One associated with creation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b592",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Sṛṣṭi-bīja.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Sṛṣṭi-bīja."
  },
  {
   "id": "b593",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The other associated with dissolution.",
   "directed": "The other associated with dissolution."
  },
  {
   "id": "b594",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Saṃhāra-bīja.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Saṃhāra-bīja."
  },
  {
   "id": "b595",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, these sounds possess a special role because they express fundamental movements of consciousness.",
   "directed": "Now, these sounds possess a special role because they express fundamental movements of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b596",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And through their contemplative use, the practitioner is said to attain:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And through their contemplative use, the practitioner is said to attain:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b597",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Para-saṃvitti.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Para-saṃvitti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b598",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Supreme consciousness.",
   "directed": "Supreme consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b599",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, here’s where Abhinavagupta makes a fascinating distinction between ordinary language and mantra.",
   "directed": "Now, here’s where Abhinavagupta makes a fascinating distinction between ordinary language and mantra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b600",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "12. Why a mantra doesn’t need to mean anything\nLet’s take an ordinary word.",
   "directed": "12. Why a mantra doesn’t need to mean anything\nLet’s take an ordinary word."
  },
  {
   "id": "b601",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Elephant.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Elephant.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b602",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, when I say elephant, you immediately imagine a gigantic grey animal.",
   "directed": "Now, when I say elephant, you immediately imagine a gigantic grey animal."
  },
  {
   "id": "b603",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Big ears.",
   "directed": "Big ears."
  },
  {
   "id": "b604",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Trunk.",
   "directed": "Trunk."
  },
  {
   "id": "b605",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The whole business.",
   "directed": "The whole business."
  },
  {
   "id": "b606",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Why?",
   "directed": "Why?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b607",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because you’ve learned that the word refers to a particular creature.",
   "directed": "Because you’ve learned that the word refers to a particular creature."
  },
  {
   "id": "b608",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The connection depends on linguistic convention.",
   "directed": "The connection depends on linguistic convention."
  },
  {
   "id": "b609",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Samaya.",
   "directed": "Samaya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b610",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But look what happens.",
   "directed": "But look what happens."
  },
  {
   "id": "b611",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "I say “elephant,” and you’ve produced an entire imagined object.",
   "directed": "I say “elephant,” and you’ve produced an entire imagined object."
  },
  {
   "id": "b612",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You can practically see the thing.",
   "directed": "You can practically see the thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b613",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And if I say:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And if I say:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b614",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Imagine an elephant riding a bicycle.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Imagine an elephant riding a bicycle.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b615",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Congratulations.",
   "directed": "Congratulations."
  },
  {
   "id": "b616",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You’ve now got an elephant on a bicycle.",
   "directed": "You’ve now got an elephant on a bicycle."
  },
  {
   "id": "b617",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Absolutely ridiculous.",
   "directed": "Absolutely ridiculous."
  },
  {
   "id": "b618",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But your imagination manages it.",
   "directed": "But your imagination manages it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b619",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Even ordinary words can evoke their referents within awareness.",
   "directed": "Even ordinary words can evoke their referents within awareness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b620",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, in this tantric account, mantra sounds possess another kind of efficacy.",
   "directed": "Now, in this tantric account, mantra sounds possess another kind of efficacy."
  },
  {
   "id": "b621",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Their capacity to awaken contact with consciousness doesn’t depend merely upon conventional semantic meaning.",
   "directed": "Their capacity to awaken contact with consciousness doesn’t depend merely upon conventional semantic meaning."
  },
  {
   "id": "b622",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The phoneme can be contemplated as vibration itself.",
   "directed": "The phoneme can be contemplated as vibration itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b623",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Saṃvit-spanda-sparśa.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Saṃvit-spanda-sparśa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b624",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Contact with the pulsation of consciousness.",
   "directed": "Contact with the pulsation of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b625",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Abhinavagupta discusses phonemes with or without their accompanying vowels.",
   "directed": "Abhinavagupta discusses phonemes with or without their accompanying vowels."
  },
  {
   "id": "b626",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "They may be internally articulated or remembered.",
   "directed": "They may be internally articulated or remembered."
  },
  {
   "id": "b627",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the essential point is that their subtle resonance can disclose a mode of awareness that doesn’t require an ordinary object of reference.",
   "directed": "And the essential point is that their subtle resonance can disclose a mode of awareness that doesn’t require an ordinary object of reference."
  },
  {
   "id": "b628",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now think about how extraordinary that is.",
   "directed": "Now think about how extraordinary that is."
  },
  {
   "id": "b629",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Ordinary language directs your attention toward something.",
   "directed": "Ordinary language directs your attention toward something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b630",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Tree.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Tree.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b631",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Mountain.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Mountain.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b632",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Elephant.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Elephant.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b633",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Tea.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Tea.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b634",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Each word has an object or meaning.",
   "directed": "Each word has an object or meaning."
  },
  {
   "id": "b635",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But here the emphasis is on the manifestation of awareness through the very movement of sound.",
   "directed": "But here the emphasis is on the manifestation of awareness through the very movement of sound."
  },
  {
   "id": "b636",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not merely:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Not merely:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b637",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "man",
   "text": "“What does this syllable mean?”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “What does this syllable mean?”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b638",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But:",
   "directed": "[short pause] But:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b639",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "What is the awareness through which the syllable appears at all?",
   "directed": "What is the awareness through which the syllable appears at all?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b640",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And how might its vibration reveal that awareness?",
   "directed": "And how might its vibration reveal that awareness?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b641",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That’s the principle behind this practice.",
   "directed": "That’s the principle behind this practice."
  },
  {
   "id": "b642",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, the chapter becomes deliberately cryptic.",
   "directed": "Now, the chapter becomes deliberately cryptic."
  },
  {
   "id": "b643",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Again.",
   "directed": "Again."
  },
  {
   "id": "b644",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "13. The secret of the Heart, throat and lips\nAbhinavagupta now says that through contact with the consciousness of Anuttara, the Heart, throat and lips are unified.",
   "directed": "13. The secret of the Heart, throat and lips\nAbhinavagupta now says that through contact with the consciousness of Anuttara, the Heart, throat and lips are unified."
  },
  {
   "id": "b645",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Hṛt.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Hṛt."
  },
  {
