  },
  {
   "id": "b651",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And beyond that, the Heart and the pair of dvādaśāntas are brought into unity.",
   "directed": "And beyond that, the Heart and the pair of dvādaśāntas are brought into unity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b652",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, dvādaśānta means a terminal point associated with twelve units of measure.",
   "directed": "Now, dvādaśānta means a terminal point associated with twelve units of measure."
  },
  {
   "id": "b653",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Within this subtle-body teaching, there are two such upper focal points associated with the divine powers.",
   "directed": "Within this subtle-body teaching, there are two such upper focal points associated with the divine powers."
  },
  {
   "id": "b654",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And all these regions have a role in the esoteric articulation of mantra.",
   "directed": "And all these regions have a role in the esoteric articulation of mantra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b655",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
