   "id": "b665",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The secret of the phoneme.",
   "directed": "The secret of the phoneme."
  },
  {
   "id": "b666",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, a rather important detail.",
   "directed": "Now, a rather important detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "b667",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The actual mantra is communicated here in coded form.",
   "directed": "The actual mantra is communicated here in coded form."
  },
  {
   "id": "b668",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And interpreting those syllables requires the wider Trika mantric system, particularly the corresponding passages of the Tantrāloka.",
   "directed": "And interpreting those syllables requires the wider Trika mantric system, particularly the corresponding passages of the Tantrāloka."
  },
  {
   "id": "b669",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So don’t imagine that we’ve got a straightforward pronunciation manual here.",
   "directed": "So don’t imagine that we’ve got a straightforward pronunciation manual here."
  },
  {
   "id": "b670",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We haven’t.",
   "directed": "We haven’t."
  },
  {
   "id": "b671",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ve got a condensed esoteric teaching.",
   "directed": "We’ve got a condensed esoteric teaching."
  },
  {
   "id": "b672",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But the philosophical principle is clear.",
   "directed": "But the philosophical principle is clear."
  },
  {
   "id": "b673",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sound becomes a means through which consciousness encounters its own expressive vibration.",
   "directed": "Sound becomes a means through which consciousness encounters its own expressive vibration."
  },
  {
   "id": "b674",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And then Abhinavagupta offers an alternative interpretation.",
   "directed": "And then Abhinavagupta offers an alternative interpretation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b675",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "14. Some people see colours\nNow, according to certain teachers, varṇa is understood differently.",
   "directed": "14. Some people see colours\nNow, according to certain teachers, varṇa is understood differently."
  },
  {
   "id": "b676",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because the Sanskrit word varṇa can also mean colour.",
   "directed": "Because the Sanskrit word varṇa can also mean colour."
  },
  {
   "id": "b677",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And in their explanation, inner colour experiences arise from the subtle apprehension of the phoneme.",
   "directed": "And in their explanation, inner colour experiences arise from the subtle apprehension of the phoneme."
  },
  {
   "id": "b678",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "White.",
   "directed": "White."
