   "directed": "[slowly] Pīta."
  },
  {
   "id": "b682",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And other colours.",
   "directed": "And other colours."
  },
  {
   "id": "b683",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "These appear within contemplative awareness, and their manifestation is said to lead the practitioner toward recognition of consciousness.",
   "directed": "These appear within contemplative awareness, and their manifestation is said to lead the practitioner toward recognition of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b684",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now isn’t that fascinating?",
   "directed": "Now isn’t that fascinating?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b685",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "One group emphasises subtle phonemic resonance.",
   "directed": "One group emphasises subtle phonemic resonance."
  },
  {
   "id": "b686",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Another emphasises an internally manifest colour experience.",
   "directed": "Another emphasises an internally manifest colour experience."
  },
  {
   "id": "b687",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But both are being interpreted through the same fundamental principle.",
   "directed": "But both are being interpreted through the same fundamental principle."
  },
  {
   "id": "b688",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The expressive power of consciousness.",
   "directed": "The expressive power of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b689",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And now Abhinavagupta gives another summary verse.",
   "directed": "And now Abhinavagupta gives another summary verse."
  },
  {
   "id": "b690",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Its meaning concerns the innate pulsation of awareness, independent of ordinary word-meaning, the lunar and solar movements of vital energy, and the attainment of balanced repose.",
   "directed": "Its meaning concerns the innate pulsation of awareness, independent of ordinary word-meaning, the lunar and solar movements of vital energy, and the attainment of balanced repose."
  },
  {
   "id": "b691",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "In the practice of bīja and piṇḍa forms of mantra, consciousness is apprehended in its fullness.",
   "directed": "In the practice of bīja and piṇḍa forms of mantra, consciousness is apprehended in its fullness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b692",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that concludes the method of varṇa.",
   "directed": "And that concludes the method of varṇa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b693",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "15. What about the body and actual ritual?\nAh, yes.",
   "directed": "15. What about the body and actual ritual?\nAh, yes."
  },
  {
   "id": "b694",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You might have noticed something.",
   "directed": "You might have noticed something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b695",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "At the beginning of this chapter, I told you there were practices involving imagination, breath, sound, the body and external ritual objects.",
   "directed": "At the beginning of this chapter, I told you there were practices involving imagination, breath, sound, the body and external ritual objects."
  },
  {
   "id": "b696",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And we’ve spent practically the entire chapter on the first three.",
   "directed": "And we’ve spent practically the entire chapter on the first three."
  },
  {
   "id": "b697",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "What about the rest?",
   "directed": "What about the rest?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b698",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Well, Abhinavagupta says:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Well, Abhinavagupta says:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b699",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Karaṇaṃ tu mudrāprakāśane vakṣyāmaḥ.",
   "directed": "Karaṇaṃ tu mudrāprakāśane vakṣyāmaḥ."
  },
  {
   "id": "b700",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "I’ll discuss bodily configurations when I explain mudrā.",
   "directed": "I’ll discuss bodily configurations when I explain mudrā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b701",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So that’s being postponed.",
   "directed": "So that’s being postponed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b702",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the external ritual supports — vessels, altars, liṅgas and so forth — will also be explained in their appropriate places later.",
   "directed": "And the external ritual supports — vessels, altars, liṅgas and so forth — will also be explained in their appropriate places later."
  },
  {
   "id": "b703",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "This chapter establishes the basic classification but concentrates on dhyāna, uccāra and varṇa.",
   "directed": "This chapter establishes the basic classification but concentrates on dhyāna, uccāra and varṇa."
  },
  {
