   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 5",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Dhiyi prāṇe dehe tadanu bahir ity āṇavatayā sa nirṇīto naiṣāṃ paraphalavidhau kāpi hi bhidā.",
